　 "Yeah?"
　 "Well, it seems that a death by FOXDIE
virus looks like a case of heart attack."
　 After a moment, Snake spoke up.
　 "Are you saying that Naomi was the one
who set this up?"
}

ページ180:{
　 "Snake, think. Did Naomi give you any kind
